B.c55=new A.fh(B.eV,"Categorized Quick Action Studio & Instant Petty Cash Logging","Upgraded the bottom (+) button into a high-speed Quick Action Studio grouped into Daily Transactions and Admissions/Notices. Added 5-second petty cash expense logging directly updating the Net Facility Profit.","Quick Action Studio","bolt","/admin/home","Try Studio (+)")
