B.c57=new A.fh(B.v4,"48-Hour Atomic Plan Reversion & Receipt Voiding","Accidentally changed a student plan? Instantly revert back to the previous plan, restore validity dates, void generated receipts, and retract wallet balances with a single tap within 48 hours.","1-Click Undo","approval","/admin/students","Student Directory")
