B.c5e=new A.fh(B.j0,"Live Anti-Fraud Status & Real-Time QR Check-In","Your digital student pass automatically updates to Active, Grace Period, or Expired with instant entry verification at the front desk.","Digital Pass","qr_code","/student/home","View Digital Pass")
B.c5f=new A.fh(B.m9,"Guaranteed Seat Hold & 1-Tap Renewal Flow","Never lose your favorite desk. Active students get an exclusive seat reservation hold badge and a streamlined 1-tap renewal flow to lock in their seat effortlessly.","Seat Protection","lock","/student/renew","Review Renewals")
